# Level 1: two rings, five items. A ring with a gap churns forever
# (the bubble circulates); a full ring is silent. 5 = 5 + 0.
name Two Rings
blurb Two belts, five items, and no way to be rid of any of them.
blurb A ring with a gap never rests: the gap itself circles forever, and the
blurb machine pays for every lap. Watch it with `t 10` if you like — the
blurb energy meter is watching too. Rings only rest full, or empty.

cycle 0 1 2 3 4
cycle 10 11 12

items 0 1 2
items 10 11

mv 2
par 4

row big 0 1 2 3 4
row small 10 11 12
